<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 17 bln levs of discount T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 17 bln levs of discount T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed two special issues of 35-day and 45-day discount T-bills worth a total of 17 billion levs and yielding 22.70 percent and 30.12 percent to maturity, respectively, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the central bank did not say with which financial intitution or institutions the issues were placed on Friday.</p>
<p>Details of issues follow. Prices are in percent of par.</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3021097004	BG3021197002</p>
<p> Type			    discount	    discount</p>
<p> Term			    35 days	     45 days</p>
<p> Issue date		    March 7	     March 7</p>
<p> Maturity date		 April 11	    April 21</p>
<p> Par value		     9,200 million levs    7,800 million levs</p>
<p> Selling price		 81.50 pct	   76.85 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity     22.70 pct	   30.12 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
</text>
